request.description:
Register a new user and receive a Sanctum API token.

**Success (201)**
```json
{
  "message": "Registration successful.",
  "token": "1|abc123...",
  "user": { "id": 1, "name": "John Doe", "email": "john@example.com" }
}
```

**Error (422) — email already taken**
```json
{
  "message": "The email has already been taken.",
  "errors": { "email": ["The email has already been taken."] }
}
```

Login and receive a token. The test script auto-saves it to the `token` variable.

**Success (200)**
```json
{
  "message": "Login successful.",
  "token": "2|xyz789...",
  "user": { "id": 1, "name": "John Doe", "email": "john@example.com" }
}
```

**Error (401)**
```json
{ "message": "Invalid credentials." }
```

Create a new order. Total is calculated server-side.

**Success (201)**
```json
{
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "user_id": 1,
    "status": "pending",
    "total": 45.00,
    "items": [
      { "id": 1, "product_name": "Widget A", "quantity": 2, "price": 10.00, "subtotal": 20.00 },
      { "id": 2, "product_name": "Widget B", "quantity": 1, "price": 25.00, "subtotal": 25.00 }
    ],
    "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000000Z"
  }
}
```

**Error (422) — empty items**
```json
{
  "message": "The items field is required.",
  "errors": { "items": ["The items field is required."] }
}
```

List all orders with optional status filter and pagination.

**Success (200)**
```json
{
  "data": [ ...orders... ],
  "meta": { "current_page": 1, "last_page": 2, "per_page": 10, "total": 15 }
}
```

Update order status and/or replace items.

**Success (200)**
```json
{
  "data": { "id": 1, "status": "confirmed", ... }
}
```

**Error (422) — invalid status**
```json
{
  "message": "The selected status is invalid.",
  "errors": { "status": ["The selected status is invalid."] }
}
```

Process a payment for an order. Order must be `confirmed`.

Supported methods: `credit_card`, `paypal`, `stripe`

**Success (201)**
```json
{
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "order_id": 1,
    "payment_method": "credit_card",
    "status": "successful",
    "gateway_response": {
      "gateway": "credit_card",
      "transaction_id": "CC-64F3A1B2C",
      "amount": 45.00,
      "currency": "USD",
      "processed_at": "2024-01-01T12:00:00.000000Z",
      "message": "Charge approved"
    },
    "created_at": "2024-01-01T12:00:00.000000Z"
  }
}
```

**Error (422) — order not confirmed**
```json
{ "message": "Payments can only be processed for confirmed orders." }
```

**Error (422) — unsupported method**
```json
{
  "message": "Unsupported payment method. Supported: credit_card, paypal, stripe.",
  "errors": { "payment_method": ["Unsupported payment method..."] }
}
```
